  - {fileID: 1411804253}
  - {fileID: 1323826569}
  - {fileID: 1473807484}
  foundMembers: []
  partyGroupSpots:
  - {fileID: 342592076}
  - {fileID: 456947088}
  - {fileID: 1082059281}
  dungeonClearText:
  - "You didn\u2019t find anyone... Maybe they were never here, or maybe you just
    missed them. Either way, the dungeon is behind you now, and their fates remain
    unknown."
  - "You managed to find someone along the way. Whether they were really part of
    your party or not... well, it\u2019s hard to tell. But in a place like this,
    anyone is better than none."
  - "Two found, one missing. You don\u2019t know their names, but it feels like leaving
    a book unfinished\u2014something important left behind."
  - Somehow, you found them all, even without knowing who they were supposed to be.
    Strangers, perhaps, but fate has a funny way of bringing people together.
